 "howToCheck": "sha256sum the file and compare with releasedSha256; the hashes under supersedes are the values older receipts record for the same path.",
 "kinds": {
  "later-revision": "The instrument was revised later in the programme, after the receipt that pins the earlier copy was written. This repository carries the later copy, because that is the one the subsequent measurements ran; the earlier hash is named here so the older receipt's pin can still be read for what it is.",
  "released-form": "The copy released here differs from the copy that was measured in comments, docstrings and installation-specific path defaults only. Where a path was involved, the measured copy carried a filesystem location that resolves on one machine as an argument default or a module constant; here each working directory is a required command-line argument and each installation-specific location is read from a named environment variable whose placeholder cannot resolve. No executable statement, threshold, decision rule, registered constant or emitted string differs, and the offline suites that cover these files pass on the released copy."
 },
