 "what": "Files in this repository whose SHA-256 a published receipt records, and which do not hash to the value that receipt recorded.",
 "why": "Each measurement's receipt pins the instrument that produced it by hash, so a reader can tell whether the file in front of them is the file that earned the number. Where the file here is not that file, this record says so, names the hash it supersedes and says why, rather than letting the two disagree silently. No receipt was edited: rewriting a receipt to match a later file would destroy the property the receipt exists for."
